# Claude Code personal settings (sandbox exceptions, permissions): never commit.
# Global ~/.gitignore_default ignores all of .claude/: a safety net, but it also hides shared files
# such as .claude/settings.json. To commit one, put `!.claude/` above this line (or `git add -f`).
